.TH LALINFERENCE_PIPE "1" "January 2026" "LALInference" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lalinference_pipe \- Setup a Condor DAG file to run the LALInference pipeline based on
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lalinference_pipe.py
[\fI\,options\/\fR] \fI\,config.ini\/\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Setup a Condor DAG file to run the LALInference pipeline based on
the config.ini file.
.PP
The user can specify either an injection file to analyse, with the \fB\-\-inj\fR option,
a list of SnglInspiralTable or CoincInspiralTable triggers with the \fB\-\-\fR<x>\-triggers options,
a GraceDB ID with the \fB\-\-gid\fR option,
or an ASCII list of GPS times with the \fB\-\-gps\-time\-file\fR option.
.PP
If none of the above options are given, the pipeline will analyse the entire
stretch of time between gps\-start\-time and gps\-end\-time, specified in the config.ini file.
.PP
The user must also specify and ini file which will contain the main analysis config.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-r\fR RUNDIR, \fB\-\-run\-path\fR=\fI\,RUNDIR\/\fR
Directory to run pipeline in (default: $PWD)
.TP
\fB\-p\fR LOGDIR, \fB\-\-daglog\-path\fR=\fI\,LOGDIR\/\fR
Path to directory to contain DAG log file. SHOULD BE
LOCAL TO SUBMIT NODE
.TP
\fB\-g\fR TIMES.txt, \fB\-\-gps\-time\-file\fR=\fI\,TIMES\/\fR.txt
Text file containing list of GPS times to analyse
.TP
\fB\-\-gid\fR=\fI\,GID\/\fR
GraceDB ID
.TP
\fB\-\-coinc\fR=\fI\,COINC\/\fR
Path to coinc.xml from GraceDB
.TP
\fB\-\-psd\fR=\fI\,PSD\/\fR
Path to psd.xml.gz from GraceDB
.TP
\fB\-\-service\-url\fR=\fI\,SERVICE_URL\/\fR
GraceDB url from which xml files are downloaded
.TP
\fB\-I\fR INJFILE.xml, \fB\-\-injections\fR=\fI\,INJFILE\/\fR.xml
List of injections to perform and analyse
.TP
\fB\-B\fR INJFILE.xml, \fB\-\-burst_injections\fR=\fI\,INJFILE\/\fR.xml
SimBurst table for LIB injections
.TP
\fB\-P\fR pipedown.sqlite, \fB\-\-pipedown\-db\fR=\fI\,pipedown\/\fR.sqlite
Pipedown database to read and analyse
.TP
\fB\-\-condor\-submit\fR
Automatically submit the condor dag
